  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogues_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5c61bd76b41291441820f8fa69e498a3, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 8179937280
    m_Localized: Welcome to ANTlANTis, a kingdom of ants where you can explore, grow,
      create and fight to the point of victory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3697082888192
    m_Localized: You will have to improve your anthill and its interior rooms to
      advance the era.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 637314045833216
    m_Localized: Enter your anthill by double clicking on the mound to start building.
      First you will need the queen's room to generate spawns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 637317124452352
    m_Localized: To build the other chambers you will need resources, not only mills,
      but also construction materials. Send the explorer ants you have to explore
      the map and collect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 647350776229888
    m_Localized: Once they come back and you have enough, you can build the breeding
      chambers to generate more types of ants that help you manage the anthill, explore
      or fight and defend yourself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 647402487803904
    m_Localized: You can build using the 1, 2, 3 and 4 keys for each type of chamber
      or tunnel. Keep in mind that some of these have quantity limits depending on
      the era in which your empire is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 647450831351808
    m_Localized: 'You can pause the game using the ESC and P keys. Here you can access
      the controls to remember them and also in the settings. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
